cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pytml in your research or teaching, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Pytml: Python in Your HTML with a Single Script Tag"
abstract: "Pytml is a lightweight (~15KB) JavaScript library that runs Python directly inside HTML using Pyodide. It requires no backend server, no build step, and includes an inline UI preprocessor for beginner-friendly controls."
version: 2.5.1
date-released: "2026-06-21"

authors:
